{
  "_implementation_notes": [
    "VERMILION CITY — Phase 2 (Complication). Maps 16, 19, 24, 25, 26, 27.",
    "Tone: Tense, militaristic. Surge represents the authoritarian pole of",
    "the fusion debate: fusion is a weapon, League is the authority.",
    "",
    "Map 24 EV002 (Surge): Full pre-battle rewrite + post-battle choice.",
    "THE CHOICE is implemented via insert_commands after badge/TM at index 50.",
    "Sets Variable 343 (SYNTH_SURGE_CHOICE) and Switches 1144-1146.",
    "",
    "Map 27 Events 6/26-28: Rival encounter on S.S. Anne rewritten for",
    "Synthesis. Rival contrasts Surge's certainty with Misty's questioning.",
    "",
    "PRESERVED: Trash can puzzle (Map 24 EV017-033), fishing contest,",
    "Bike Voucher, HM01 Cut, all trades, move tutors, Old Rod.",
    "",
    "Line length limit: ~42 characters per line for RPG Maker XP text box."
  ],
