    "25": {
      "name": "Pok\u00e9mon Fan Club",
      "events": {
        "2": {
          "name": "EV002 (Seel Lover)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I just love my Seel! They wanted",
                    "to fuse it at the lab, but I",
                    "said no. It squeals when I hug",
                    "it — why would I change that?"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "4": {
          "name": "EV004 (Fan Club Member)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Keep your team however you like",
                    "— fused, pure-bred, whatever.",
                    "We just celebrate them. The",
                    "Chairman, though? He's... vocal."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "5": {
          "name": "EV005 (Chairman — Rapidash Rant + Bike Voucher)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I chair the Pok\u00e9mon Fan Club!",
                    "I have collected over 100",
                    "Pok\u00e9mon!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Unlike most trainers, I like my",
                    "Pok\u00e9mon pure-bred. No fusions",
                    "for this old man! My Rapidash",
                    "is perfect as she is."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "So... Did you come visit to",
                    "hear about my Pok\u00e9mon?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 11,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Good! Then listen up! My",
                    "favorite Rapidash..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 13,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It...cute...lovely...smart...",
                    "plus...amazing...you think so?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 15,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "...oh yes...it...stunning...",
                    "kindly...love it!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 17,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Hug it...when...sleeping...",
                    "warm and cuddly...",
                    "spectacular...ravishing..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 22,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "She's not a weapon. She's my",
                    "friend. ...Oops! Look at the",
                    "time! I kept you too long!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 24,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Thanks for hearing me out!",
                    "I want you to have this!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 28,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Exchange that for a bicycle",
                    "in Cerulean City!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 30,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Don't worry about me, my",
                    "Fearow will fly me anywhere!",
                    "I don't need a bicycle!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 33,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I hope you like cycling!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 38,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Oh. Come back when you want",
                    "to hear my story!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"switch1_id": 77},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 0,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Hello, \\PN! Come to hear about",
                    "my Pok\u00e9mon again? They're all",
                    "natural — no fusions. And",
                    "they're perfect that way."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
